  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your gaze pierces fog, murk and gloom.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Fiend Sight<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can see through fog without penalty, ignoring any cover or concealment bonuses from fog or vapors. This does not allow you to see anything you could not otherwise see (for example, invisible creatures are still invisible).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc148\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
